    "title": "Too Soon For Next Year? Vikings Release 2026 Scheduled Opponents - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paul Shea ,\n3 hours ago We're just about to start week 5 in the 2025 NFL season, and the Minnesota Vikings have already announced a majority of the opponents they will face in 2026. We know that the Vikings will play the other 3 NFC North teams twice, once at home and once away, but who else will they be playing in 2026? Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
